  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Selective Channeling",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook",
    "definition_raw": "You can choose whom to affect when you channel energy.\n\nPrerequisite: Cha 13, channel energy class feature.\n\nBenefit: When you channel energy, you can choose a number of targets in the area up to your Charisma modifier. These targets are not affected by your channeled energy.\n\nNormal: All targets in a 30-foot burst are affected when you channel energy. You can only choose whether or not you are affected.",
